WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
[MYCARTOON.ORG] Landing page & age-gate authentication

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:14.000
User selects a cartoon theme and character preferences

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
[Voice Director] Real-time voice direction via Gemini Live API

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Child speaks: the AI interprets intent and generates a story script

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
[Scene Generation] DALL-E 3 creates scene illustrations

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Veo 2 renders each scene as a short animated video clip

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.000
[Cartoon Playback] Assembled cartoon begins playing

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Full 30-minute episode with voice-matched narration

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.000
[Mini-Games] Interactive games during production wait time

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.500
Whack-a-Mole and Bubble Pop keep children engaged
